/* Main compact card price: RUB primary, EUR secondary. */



/* ONE service-strip appearance, exact same in every card type. */




/* Remove any older dark-blue service-strip styling with stronger selectors. */


/* Related and quick-view service text should stay secondary, never headline-like. */
#productQuickRelated .pq-float-related-picked,
